WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.507
First, the crust.

00:00:01.957 --> 00:00:07.510
It is about 7 km thick under the
oceans, and 30 to 50 km under the

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:08.436
continents.

00:00:08.886 --> 00:00:12.079
For the size of the Earth, that is
thinner than an eggshell.

00:00:12.528 --> 00:00:17.818
Its base is the Moho, named after
Andrija Mohorovičić, who found it in

00:00:17.818 --> 00:00:21.294
1909 in the waves of an earthquake in
Croatia.
